{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_vort_x",
    "description": "The zonal C-grid vorticity rewrite target D(v, wrt: x) on the mom6_cgrid: lowers the spatial derivative of the meridional face velocity field v [i,j,k] (the north-face velocity of each T cell) to the q-point zonal derivative of the meridional volume transport dvdx(i,j,k) = v(i+1,j,k)*dyCv(i+1,j) - v(i,j,k)*dyCv(i,j) (the forward difference dvdx(I,J) = v(i+1,J,k)*G%dyCv(i+1,J) - v(i,J,k)*G%dyCv(i,J) of MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90:322-323, with v(i+1,j) the north-face velocity of the east neighbor cell, i.e. the v at the east side of the q-point, and dyCv(i+1,j) its face length; the vorticity is second-order accurate with free-slip boundaries). SOLID-WALL BOUNDARY: the q-point row at the east domain edge (i = N_I) has no east neighbor cell, and with free-slip walls the vorticity derivative is identically zero there, so the i = N_I region is the EXPLICIT free-slip wall value dvdx(N_I,j,k) = 0 — NOT the clamped difference (v(N_I)*dyCv(N_I) - v(N_I)*dyCv(N_I)) = 0 of a naive halo closure (the clamped form happens to evaluate to zero here, but it hides the wall as if the face velocity vanished, so this rule states the wall explicitly). The rule is a GROUND per-variable selector (esm-spec 9.6.1): v is NOT a parameter, so the match arg \"v\" is a literal that fires only on the derivative of the declared variable named v — mixed-scheme per-variable selection on one axis — and carries priority 20 so it outranks the wildcard sibling mom6_cgrid_div_x (priority 10, whose uh IS a parameter), which matches any [i,j,k] operand, whenever both are imported. The body is a pure forward difference of the face transport — no reconstruction (the momentum PV advection is centered, PV_ADV_CENTERED). v and dyCv are free names resolved in the consuming model (the free-name contract of grids/mom6_cgrid/grid.esm); the body's v is the matched operand, so a consumer must bind the derivative target's operand to a declared field named v (esm-spec 9.6.1, the same bare-variable discipline as a where shape constraint).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:mom6_cgrid",
      "grid:mom6_cgrid",
      "op:vort",
      "order:1",
      "bc:wall",
      "axes:i,j,k",
      "spec:9.6.8"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc, dvdx at :322-323 (Stokes_VF = .false. branch); the q-point convention of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_cgrid_vort_x": {
      "params": [],
      "priority": 20,
      "match": {
        "op": "D",
        "args": ["v"],
        "wrt": "x"
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
            [1, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            ["N_I", "N_I"],
            [1, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["v", "dyCv"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
              "j": [1, "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["dyCv", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["v", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["dyCv", "i", "j"]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["v", "i", "j", "k"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          0.0
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
